OL,3,GNEWSA'I cycled across America in memory
OL,4,Aof my wife - I know she's proud of me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeclan Faulkner and his wife Patrina
OL,7,Falways intended to return to the United
OL,8,FStates, a place they visited shortly
OL,9,Fafter getting married almost 30 years
OL,10,Fago, and maybe make a cross-country
OL,11,Ftrip.
OL,13,FBut, as is sometimes the case, life had
OL,14,Fother plans.
OL,16,FThey moved close to Patrina's home
OL,17,Fvillage of Ballygawley, County Tyrone,
OL,18,Fdeveloped their careers, raised three
OL,19,Fchildren ` and then Patrina was
OL,20,Fdiagnosed with breast cancer. Four
OL,21,Fyears later, in 2017, she died.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
