OL,3,GNEWSA'I cycled across America in memory
OL,4,Aof my wife - I know she's proud of me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Declan never forgot the journey
OL,7,Fthey were meant to take together `
OL,8,Fwhich is why the 55-year-old just spent
OL,9,Fseven weeks cycling coast-to-coast
OL,10,Facross the US, from Portland, Oregon on
OL,11,Fthe west coast to Portland, Maine.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
